  "goodToKnow": "Dämmen means to insulate against heat or sound: Fassaden, Dächer, Rohre dämmen. Die Wärmedämmung and Schalldämmung are thermal and sound insulation, central to energy-efficient renovation. Literally, dämmen means to hold back water with a Damm (dam), and eindämmen means to contain. Regular: dämmte, gedämmt."
